WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
You are so interesting

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,440
It’s not that I picked three minus four.

3
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:04,120
You should at least find a good one.

4
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,560
Think about how long you have been studying medicine.

5
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,120
Such a high degree of education and such a good job

6
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,040
Just find a coolie

7
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,160
Do you think this is appropriate?

8
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,720
Where do you want me and your father to put our dignity?

9
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,960
So you guys are really funny, it’s something I’m happy with

10
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:14,120
Why are you unhappy again?

11
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,160
It’s not like he asked you to marry him

12
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,200
It was me who married him

13
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,120
Aren't you using strong words to make sense?

14
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,840
I want you to find a good one

15
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,320
It’s not for your future life

16
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,520
can live better

17
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,000
What's wrong with me?

18
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,120
Just on my own salary

19
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,320
can support the family

20
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:28,160
Didn't you see that everyone's appearance is unusual?

21
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:29,360
What's the use of looking unusual?

22
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,640
Can I still be used as food if I look good?

23
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,760
Maybe it's possible

24
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,200
I'm quite willing to give him food.

25
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,680
Do you think what you are saying makes sense?

26
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,360
Who would want to marry you when you look like this?

27
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:37,360
You reminded me

28
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,240
I don't even know if he is willing to marry me.

29
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,960
What if he doesn't want to marry me?

30
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,840
Then am I not blind in vain?

31
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,920
I don't care about you, you, you

32
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,320
Anyway, I don’t agree with this marriage.

33
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,800
If you don't agree, it's fine if I agree.

34
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,840
Mom, stop talking

35
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,160
I know it well

36
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,040
Anyway, I don't agree to open the door.

37
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:57,420
Open the door for me, Brother Long, and beat him up

38
00:00:57,420 --> 00:00:59,100
This guy’s reminder is too big, right?

39
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,860
Why are you taller than me?
